      <div type="clause" n="7">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 7</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Liceteras ⁊ leogeras, ryperas ⁊ hreaferas Godes graman habban, buton hig geswican ⁊ ðe deoppor gebetan.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Hypocrites and liars, robbers and plunderers shall incur the wrath of God, unless they desist and make amends to the utmost.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Licceteras ⁊ leogeras, ryperas ⁊ reaferas Godes graman habban, butan hig geswican ⁊ þe deoppar gebetan.</ab>
